      "citation_relevance": 1.0,
      "answer_text": "The Secure attribute restricts a cookie's scope to \"secure\" channels (typically HTTP over Transport Layer Security (TLS) [RFC2818]), where \"secure\" is defined by the user agent (RFC 6265 \u00a74.1.2.5).\n\nThe HttpOnly attribute restricts a cookie's scope to HTTP requests, instructing the user agent to omit the cookie when providing access to cookies via \"non-HTTP\" APIs (RFC 6265 \u00a74.1.2.6).\n\nThe two attributes are independent of each other (RFC 6265 \u00a74.1.2.6)."
    },
